{'problem_index': 46, 'code': 'theorem algebra_amgm_prod1toneq1_sum1tongeqn (a : ℕ → NNReal) (n : ℕ)\n  (h₀ : Finset.prod (Finset.range n) a = 1) : Finset.sum (Finset.range n) a ≥ n := by\n  have h₁ : ∀ i ∈ Finset.range n, a i ≥ 1 := by\n    intro i hi\n    have h₂ : ∏ j in Finset.range n, a j = 1 := h₀\n    have h₃ : a i ≥ 1 := by\n      apply?\n      <;> simp_all [Finset.prod_eq_one]\n      <;> aesop\n    exact h₃\n  have h₂ : Finset.sum (Finset.range n) a ≥ n := by\n    calc\n      Finset.sum (Finset.range n) a ≥ ∑ i in Finset.range n, (1 : NNReal) := by\n        exact Finset.sum_le_sum fun i hi => h₁ i hi\n      _ = n := by simp\n  exact h₂', 'result': {'messages': [{'severity': 'info', 'pos': {'line': 17, 'column': 14}, 'endPos': {'line': 17, 'column': 15}, 'data': "The '∏ x in s, f x' notation is deprecated: please use '∏ x ∈ s, f x' instead:\n∏ j ∈ Finset.range n, a j"}, {'severity': 'info', 'pos': {'line': 19, 'column': 6}, 'endPos': {'line': 19, 'column': 12}, 'data': 'Try this: refine NNReal.one_le_coe.mp ?_'}, {'severity': 'info', 'pos': {'line': 19, 'column': 6}, 'endPos': {'line': 19, 'column': 12}, 'data': 'Try this: refine ENNReal.one_le_coe_iff.mp ?_'}, {'severity': 'info', 'pos': {'line': 19, 'column': 6}, 'endPos': {'line': 19, 'column': 12}, 'data': 'Try this: refine NNReal.one_le_sqrt.mp ?_'}, {'severity': 'info', 'pos': {'line': 19, 'column': 6}, 'endPos': {'line': 19, 'column': 12}, 'data': 'Try this: refine NNReal.le_of_forall_lt_one_mul_le ?_'}, {'severity': 'info', 'pos': {'line': 19, 'column': 6}, 'endPos': {'line': 19, 'column': 12}, 'data': 'found a partial proof, but the corresponding tactic failed:\n  refine (NNReal.div_le_div_left ?_ ?_ ?_).mp ?_'}, {'severity': 'info', 'pos': {'line': 19, 'column': 6}, 'endPos': {'line': 19, 'column': 12}, 'data': 'Try this: refine NNReal.le_of_forall_pos_le_add ?_'}, {'severity': 'info', 'pos': {'line': 19, 'column': 6}, 'endPos': {'line': 19, 'column': 12}, 'data': 'Try this: refine NNReal.coe_le_co